 Experience Designer","Learning Product Specialist","Learning Product Manager","Education Product Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Important future technologies include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"AI tutors"},{"text":"Adaptive learning"},{"text":"Learning analytics"},{"text":"AR/VR learning"},{"text":"Educational simulations"},{"text":"Gamification"},{"text":"Intelligent assessment"},{"text":"AI-generated multimedia"},{"text":"Speech-based learning"},{"text":"Personalized learning platforms"},{"text":"Knowledge graphs"},{"text":"Competency-based learning systems"}]}]},{"heading":"Content Quality Framework","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional should evaluate every educational resource using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accuracy"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Age Appropriateness"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Pedagogical Quality"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Learning Outcome Alignment"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Inclusivity"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Assessment Alignment"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Visual Quality"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Fact Verification"},{"text":"Good-looking content is not necessarily good educational content."}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand their subject deeply"},{"text":"Explain concepts clearly"},{"text":"Write age-appropriate educational content"},{"text":"Design lesson plans"},{"text":"Create learning objectives"},{"text":"Structure educational modules"},{"text":"Develop worksheets"},{"text":"Create question banks"},{"text":"Design assessments"},{"text":"Create digital presentations"},{"text":"Develop educational video scripts"},{"text":"Create basic digital learning experiences"},{"text":"Understand instructional design"},{"text":"Use LMS platforms"},{"text":"Conduct educational research"},{"text":"Use AI for content development"},{"text":"Fact-check AI-generated content"},{"text":"Build a professional content portfolio"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Graduation Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Portfolio Component","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Lesson Plans"},{"text":"10–20"}],[{"text":"Digital Learning Modules"},{"text":"3–5"}],[{"text":"Educational Articles"},{"text":"5–10"}],[{"text":"Question Bank"},{"text":"100+ questions"}],[{"text":"Educational Videos"},{"text":"5–10"}],[{"text":"Workbook"},{"text":"1"}],[{"text":"Complete Mini-Course"},{"text":"1"}],[{"text":"Assessment Blueprint"},{"text":"2"}],[{"text":"Curriculum Map"},{"text":"1–2"}],[{"text":"AI-Assisted Content Project"},{"text":"1"}],[{"text":"Content/EdTech Internship"},{"text":"1+"}]]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ITEP / B.Sc-B.Ed / BA-B.Ed"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Subject Expertise"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Educational Psychology"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Pedagogy"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Educational Writing"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Instructional Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Learning Outcomes"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Assessment Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Question-Bank Development"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Digital Content Creation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Visual Communication"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"LMS / E-Learning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Educational Research"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Content QA / Fact Checking"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Portfolio"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Content / EdTech Internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For an ITEP / B.Sc-B.Ed / BA-B.Ed graduate, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Subject Expert","Educator","Digital Content Creator","Instructional Designer"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Rather 